This portfolio explores signal processing, feature extraction, and AI-based control logic inspired by Spark Biomedical’s mission to
deliver wearable neurostimulation solutions for opioid withdrawal and related conditions.

Notebooks:

1. Biosignal Filtering and Visualization

2. Feature Extraction (HRV, spectral power)

3. Stress-State Detection with Machine Learning

4. Closed-Loop Control Simulation

5. Interactive Visualization of Neurostimulation Response
